        },
        {
          "text": "Ahoeni korekoghe na malaya gha womi na gha waka isangenyi. Wandu wa Juda wikabonya wuchafu ghose ghorebonywagha ni iro mbari zima BWANA oreriwingieghe imbiri ya wandu wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
